  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Culture Fund for Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cultural Fund for Malawi will contribute to the promotion of cultural rights  by providing financial and technical support to cultural practitioners and institutions. This will lead to a strengthened cultural sector capable of participating actively in democratic processes, having rights to freedom of expressions, able to hold decision maker accountable, and contributing to economic development.</narrative>
  </description>
